profile: tinyrustlm.report-synthesis.current.v1
updated_utc: 2026-08-28T00:00:00Z
canonical_memory: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-enterprise-intake-and-production-runtime-clean-cut-memory-2026-08-28.md
report_decision_index: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-report-intake-decision-index-2026-08-28.md

current_batch:
  reports: 47
  dates: 2026-08-26 and 2026-08-27
  custody: Byte-exact source-controlled reports, three manifests, reviewed syntheses, TDD deltas, wiki memory, and report-level ledger entries.
  decision: Incorporate bounded production invariants with corrections; retain speculative architectures as baseline-gated research; reject product-scope expansion and alternate runtimes.

adopted:
  - One exact six-member SLM2 composition and one clean-slate runtime path.
  - Independent contract validation and immutable evidence.
  - Pinned-source to scalar-native to optimized-native to real-browser-WASM differential proof.
  - Declarative tokenizer/template/prompt/sampling closure and explicit authority ordering.
  - Worker-owned generation, exactly-once event identity, real cancellation, fresh-worker recovery, and clean-profile evidence.
  - Exact qualified P2P composition or explicit local conversion, never instruction-file acquisition.
  - Source-first quality screening, sealed metamorphic holdouts, contamination control, and human adjudication.
  - Typed claims, provenance, explicit conflicts, bounded resources, synchronized docs/releases, and honest counters.

corrected:
  - Rust emitted /10 durability child parent + -members with performed; the managed verifier expected the wrong parent/flushed form. /10 remains terminal failure.
  - Qwen3 authority is 28 layers, 16 query heads, and 8 KV heads.
  - Model vocabulary capacity 151936 differs from tokenizer entries 151669.
  - Scalar native is the converted-byte reference; pinned source framework is upstream semantic authority.
  - Mixed-Q8 does not imply Q8_0, TurboQuant, 1-bit weights, or report-proposed packing.
  - Browser zero-copy, fixed limits, performance, numerical bounds, and quality margins require local measurement.

research_only: e-graphs; energy models; sequence memory; neural algorithmic reasoning; world models; probabilistic programs; topological/sheaf/HDC/Koopman/neural-field representations; specialists; TurboVec/TurboQuant; alternative KV compression.
rejected: monolithic OMI kernel; alternate runtimes; self-modification; physical control; latent authority protocols; arbitrary model slicing; hidden fallback/repair/retry; report-derived production claims.

memory_policy:
  agent_lane: Direct MemoryEndpoints long-term memory, meetings, handoffs, and coordination across ecosystem agents.
  user_lane: TinyRustLM.com Connect plugin sign-in and selected MemoryEndpoints long-term memory.
  resilience: Synchronized duplicate prelaunch memory is permitted; stale or secret-leaking copies are not.
  evidence: Both lanes remain unproven live until exact authorized receipts exist.
